    "body": "Hey, thanks for contributing your idea. I find the arguments against the current approach a little hard to follow. It also seems to me that using async iterators would incur some overhead as well as result in some delay due to promises.\r\n\r\nHaving said that, if this were an extremely popular way to consume node tree mutations I could be persuaded to add an API for it. Have you developed this into a library for people to use?",
